189
00:07:51.639 --> 00:07:56.220
So the opacity is in here so that we can actually choose

190
00:07:57.399 --> 00:08:00.040
when we choose our subsurface here on the top,

191
00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:02.439
not profile, that's profile, it's different.

192
00:08:02.439 --> 00:08:04.939
When we choose subsurface, it allows us to have

193
00:08:04.939 --> 00:08:07.959
an opacity to be able to actually have light

194
00:08:07.959 --> 00:08:09.720
