195
00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:13.120
But what I mean by it bending and changing,

196
00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:14.939
cause it isn't translucent,

197
00:08:14.939 --> 00:08:18.139
is this Fernal Index pushes out a bit farther.

198
00:08:18.139 --> 00:08:22.139
So we're able to have light go through it in such a way,

199
00:08:22.139 --> 00:08:24.420
but it isn't quite translucent.

200
00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:27.379
So it isn't like fully going through this.

201
00:08:27.379 --> 00:08:30.160
We're controlling the amounts,

202
00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:32.379
not necessarily how you can see through it,

203
00:08:32.379 --> 00:08:36.220
but how the light imitates how it's passing

204
00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:37.120
